    "message": "Fixed HTTPS Google destinations only, with access to the destination and initiator. Last headers for up to eight hosts, not a global browser ID. Navigation capture requires existing all-sites access and unambiguous browser events within two seconds. Chrome-internal traffic and inaccessible frames are not covered. Values expire after ten minutes and disappear on clear, pause, access change or service-worker restart. Chrome normally omits its variations header in Incognito. No flags, cookies or CAPTCHA scores are read."
